message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
authors:
  - family-names: "TEUMA MBEZI"
    given-names: "Michel"
    email: "3michelteuma@gmail.com"
title: "Multi-Agent Chemical Analyzer with Uncertainty Quantification"
version: 2.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-15
url: "https://github.com/FullMichel-Lab/chem-agents-v2"    

abstract: >
  A LangGraph-based multi-agent system for molecular property prediction,
  structural optimization, and uncertainty quantification. The system
  orchestrates four specialized agents (data retrieval, descriptor computation,
  property prediction, optimization suggestion) with PubChem anchoring and
  conformal prediction for uncertainty intervals.
keywords:
  - agentic AI
  - LangGraph
  - multi-agent system
  - molecular property prediction
  - uncertainty quantification
  - conformal prediction
  - cheminformatics
license: MIT
